# Secrets are separated per Kamal destination:
#   - Copy .kamal/secrets.staging.example    -> .kamal/secrets.staging    (for `kamal <cmd> -d staging`)
#   - Copy .kamal/secrets.production.example -> .kamal/secrets.production (for `kamal <cmd> -d production`)
# Both destination secret files are gitignored and excluded by .dockerignore.
# See "Deploying staging and production on Unraid" in README.md for the full setup order.
